onda de rádio agita elétrons da bobina.', '["tecnologia de comunicação da etiqueta RFID","nitrogênio (N ).","amônia (NH ).","propano (C H ).","dióxido de carbono (CO )."]'::jsonb, '"dióxido de carbono (CO )."'::jsonb, null, 4, 'INEP_OFFICIAL', 'https://www.gov.br/inep/pt-br/areas-de-atuacao/avaliacao-e-exames-educacionais/enem/provas-e-gabaritos/2018', '{"canonical_id":"170c8b2205c735336dc0ea8e83bd19eb19bb6841ece8e671883487cd8496c6a9","source_integrity":"VERIFIED","render_mode":"HYBRID","render_ready":true,"area_verified":true,"enem_subject":"QUIMICA","subject_verified":false,"classification_reason_code":"CLASSIFICATION_CANDIDATE_QUIMICA","classification_source_fingerprint":"5cf9294e88ffe13f1374027d9d4783e3ee47d5401d60975e30eb6a459636a488","statement_assets":[{"assetRole":"STATEMENT","mediaType":"STATEMENT_CROP","questionNumber":132,"language":null,"page":15,"storagePath":"2018-D2-CD6/question-132-COMMON/statement-page-15.png","sha256":"187fd9207e202468e55c03ac6e6302c606bd76dcad61d1f2ee77975fe74538d8","crop":{"left":0,"bottom":351.9368,"width":315.14417499999996,"height":207.84890000000013}}],"enem_area":"CIENCIAS_NATUREZA","pedagogical_enrichment":"PENDING","adaptive_evidence_enabled":false,"official_answer_letter":"E","official_occurrence_count":1,"annulled":false,"source_provenance":{"year":2018,"exam":"ENEM","application":"REGULAR","day":"D2","booklet":"CD6","question_number":132,"language":null,"source_page":15,"source_sha256":"c943ad2355a8b3eb844b81043ead17f497b2f19b3ddc5a2e442dc34417a729d5"}}'::jsonb, true) returning id into v_question_id; end if;
